{"seq":1,"slug":"regex-theory","title":"正则表达式的理论根基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/regex-theory","wordCount":1647,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"正则表达式的理论根基\">正则表达式的理论根基</h1><p>1951 年，Stephen Kleene 在一篇研究神经网络事件表示的论文里，为了描述「哪些事件序列能被一个有限状态的神经元网络识别」，提出了一套后来被称为「正则事件」的代数。他当时没有想到，这套用三个运算符——连接、选择、闭包——拼出来的小小代数，会在七十多年后成为每一台计算机里都跑着的文本匹配工具的数学心脏。今天我们写的 <code>a*b+</code>，本质上就是 Kleene 代数的一个表达式;Kleene 闭包那个上标的星号,直接以他的名字命名为 Kleene star。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>正则表达式的理论之所以优雅，是因为它把三件看起来毫不相关的东西证明成了同一回事：一个正则表达式、一台有限自动机、一条正则文法，描述的是完全相同的语言集合。这条等价链是整个领域的基石——它意味着你可以在任意一种表示之间自由翻译，而本 hub 第二章讲的 <a href=\"../automata/nfa-construction\">Thompson 构造法</a>正是「表达式 → 自动机」这个方向的具体算法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  RE[&quot;正则表达式&lt;br/&gt;a(b|c)*&quot;] --&gt;|Thompson 构造| NFA[&quot;非确定有限自动机 NFA&quot;]&#10;  NFA --&gt;|子集构造| DFA[&quot;确定有限自动机 DFA&quot;]&#10;  DFA --&gt;|Kleene 定理| RE&#10;  NFA --&gt;|状态即非终结符| RG[&quot;正则文法&lt;br/&gt;右线性产生式&quot;]&#10;  RG --&gt;|等价| RE\">graph TD\n  RE[\"正则表达式&lt;br/&gt;a(b|c)*\"] --&gt;|Thompson 构造| NFA[\"非确定有限自动机 NFA\"]\n  NFA --&gt;|子集构造| DFA[\"确定有限自动机 DFA\"]\n  DFA --&gt;|Kleene 定理| RE\n  NFA --&gt;|状态即非终结符| RG[\"正则文法&lt;br/&gt;右线性产生式\"]\n  RG --&gt;|等价| RE</pre><p>下表把这条等价链上的四种表示并排放在一起，每一种都能识别同一类语言，区别只在「适合人写」「适合机器跑」还是「适合做证明」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示形式</th>\n<th>长什么样</th>\n<th>擅长</th>\n<th>由谁保证等价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正则表达式</td>\n<td><code>a(b|c)*</code></td>\n<td>人类书写</td>\n<td>Kleene 定理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NFA</td>\n<td>带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 转移的状态图</td>\n<td>编译的中间形式</td>\n<td>Thompson 构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DFA</td>\n<td>每态每符号唯一后继</td>\n<td>高速匹配</td>\n<td>子集构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正则文法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\to aT,\\ T \\to bT \\mid \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>形式语言证明</td>\n<td>文法-自动机对应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三个基本运算\">三个基本运算</h2><p>Kleene 代数只需要三个运算就能生成全部正则语言，工程语法里那些花哨的符号统统是这三者的语法糖。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两个语言（字符串集合）：</p>\n<p><strong>连接（concatenation）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1 \\cdot L_2 = \\{ xy \\mid x \\in L_1, y \\in L_2 \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。把两个语言的串首尾相接，对应表达式里两个子模式紧挨着写，如 <code>ab</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>选择（alternation / union）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1 \\cup L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对应 <code>a|b</code>，即「要么匹配左边要么匹配右边」。</p>\n<p><strong>闭包（Kleene closure）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^* = \\bigcup_{i=0}^{\\infty} L^i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1244em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^0 = \\{\\varepsilon\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（空串），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^{i+1} = L^i \\cdot L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>。这是唯一引入「无限」的运算，对应 <code>a*</code>，意思是「重复零次或多次」。常见的 <code>a+</code> 不过是 <code>aa*</code> 的缩写，<code>a?</code> 则是 <code>a|\\varepsilon</code> 的缩写。</p>\n<p>这三个运算加上基础元素（单个字符、空集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>、空串 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>）的递归组合，定义了「正则表达式」这个语法对象。任何由它们生成的语言，就是一个正则语言——这个概念在 <a href=\"formal-languages\">形式语言与正则语言</a> 里会被严格刻画其边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优先级与代数律\">优先级与代数律</h2><p>三个运算之间有固定的结合优先级，这决定了 <code>ab*</code> 到底是「a 后跟零个或多个 b」还是「ab 重复」。标准优先级从高到低是：闭包（<code>*</code>）&gt; 连接 &gt; 选择（<code>|</code>）。所以 <code>ab*</code> 解析为 <code>a·(b*)</code>，<code>a|bc</code> 解析为 <code>a|(b·c)</code>。括号用来改写优先级，这一点和算术表达式完全一致。</p>\n<p>正则代数满足一组代数律，引擎在优化阶段（见 <a href=\"../advanced/optimizations\">引擎优化技术</a>）会悄悄利用它们来化简模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接对选择的分配律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a(b|c) = ab|ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>选择的幂等律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a|a = a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>闭包的不动点性质：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^* = \\varepsilon | a a^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，这条递归式正是 Thompson 模拟里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 环的来源</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些律不是装饰品。<code>(a|a)*</code> 经过幂等律化简成 <code>a*</code> 后，回溯引擎的灾难性回溯风险就从根本上消失了——这正是第四章 <a href=\"../advanced/redos-security\">ReDoS 与正则安全</a> 讨论的预防手段之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kleene-定理-为什么这一切成立\">Kleene 定理：为什么这一切成立</h2><p>把上面的等价链落到一句严谨的话上，就是 Kleene 定理：<strong>一个语言能被某个有限自动机识别，当且仅当它能被某个正则表达式描述。</strong> 定理的两个方向各自对应一个构造性算法，因此它不只是存在性证明，更是引擎实现的施工图。</p>\n<p>「表达式 → 自动机」方向由 Thompson 构造法给出，它对正则表达式的语法树做结构归纳，每个运算符对应一小块 NFA 拼装规则。「自动机 → 表达式」方向由状态消除法（state elimination）或 Brzozowski 代数方法给出，工程上用得少，但它保证了 DFA 最小化之后仍可还原回某个等价正则。</p>\n<p>这条定理的工程意义在于：它把「正则匹配」从一个看似需要无限内存的问题（毕竟 <code>a*</code> 能匹配任意长的串），降维成了一个有限状态机问题——无论输入多长，机器只需记住「当前处在哪个状态」这一个有限的信息。这正是自动机型引擎能保证线性时间的根本原因，详见 <a href=\"../automata/thompson-nfa\">Thompson NFA 模拟</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"理论与工程的裂缝\">理论与工程的裂缝</h2><p>需要立刻澄清一个贯穿全 hub 的关键事实：程序员每天用的「正则表达式」，在理论意义上往往<strong>不是</strong>正则的。回引（backreference，如 <code>(\\w+)\\1</code> 要求后半段与捕获的前半段相同）让模式能表达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>w</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{ww \\mid w \\in \\Sigma^*\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 这类非正则语言；前后查找（lookahead/lookbehind）虽然不增加表达力，但也无法直接塞进纯 NFA。</p>\n<p>这道裂缝不是缺陷，而是工程对理论的有意越界，它直接造就了两条引擎路线的分野：回溯型引擎（见 <a href=\"../engines/backtracking-engines\">回溯型引擎</a>）拥抱了这些超能力，代价是放弃线性时间保证;自动机型引擎（见 <a href=\"../engines/automata-engines\">自动机型引擎：RE2 路线</a>）坚守纯正则的理论边界，换来对任意输入的运行时间承诺。理解了 Kleene 代数能表达什么、不能表达什么，才能真正看懂这场延续至今的工程取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>正则表达式起源于 Kleene 1951 年的正则代数，三个基本运算——连接、选择、闭包——足以生成全部正则语言。</li>\n<li>Kleene 定理把正则表达式、有限自动机、正则文法证明为等价，这条链是引擎实现的施工图。</li>\n<li>运算优先级为「闭包 &gt; 连接 &gt; 选择」，代数律（分配、幂等、不动点）是引擎优化的理论依据。</li>\n<li>有限状态意味着匹配只需有限内存，这是自动机型引擎线性时间保证的根源。</li>\n<li>工程正则因回引等特性突破了理论正则的边界，这道裂缝是后续两条引擎路线分野的起点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"正则表达式的理论根基","id":"正则表达式的理论根基"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个基本运算","id":"三个基本运算"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级与代数律","id":"优先级与代数律"},{"level":2,"text":"Kleene 定理：为什么这一切成立","id":"kleene-定理-为什么这一切成立"},{"level":2,"text":"理论与工程的裂缝","id":"理论与工程的裂缝"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"形式语言与正则语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/regex-engine-implementation/foundations/formal-languages"}}